                        <h2>Join <em>150,000+ users</em> and automate workflows on your desktop and in the browser.</h2>
                        <a class="get-button" href="#get">Get started: <i class="fa fa-chevron-right"></i><br> <small>Install the free browser extension!</small> </a>
