    <div class="row">
        <div>
            <p>
                Easy hybrid workflow automation with Selenium-style commands, Computer Vision/OCR, and AI - all from a simple browser extension.

            </p>
            <p>
                Get started with:
                Ui.Vision <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/uivision/gcbalfbdmfieckjlnblleoemohcganoc">⭳for Chrome</a>,
                <a href="https://microsoftedge.microsoft.com/addons/detail/uivision/goapmjinbaeomoemgdcnnhoedopjnddd">⭳for Edge</a>, or
                <a href="https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/rpa/">⭳for Firefox</a>.
            </p>
            <p>
                The browser extension enables automation of both browser-based workflows and desktop applications across Windows, Mac, and Linux.
            </p>
            <p>
                Ui.Vision is open-source and provides <a href="/rpa#security">enterprise-grade security</a>.

                <span class="hiblue">Your data never leaves your machine. Everything runs local.</span>.

            </p>


